```json
{
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "dist",
  "framework": "react",
  "nodeVersion": "18.x",
  "installCommand": "npm ci",
  "env": {
    "REACT_APP_API_ENDPOINT": {
      "type": "plaintext",
      "description": "Backend API base URL (e.g., https://api.example.com or http://localhost:3001)"
    },
    "REACT_APP_API_TIMEOUT": {
      "type": "plaintext",
      "value": "30000",
      "description": "API request timeout in milliseconds"
    },
    "REACT_APP_ENVIRONMENT": {
      "type": "plaintext",
      "description": "Environment name: development, staging, or production"
    }
  },
  "envFile": [
    ".env.local",
    ".env"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "iad1"
  ],
  "functions": {
    "api/**.js": {
      "runtime": "nodejs18.x",
      "maxDuration": 30,
      "memory": 1024
    }
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/api/(.*)",
      "destination": "https://api.example.com/$1"
    }
  ],
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/api/:path*",
      "destination": "/api/:path*"
    },
    {
      "source": "/:path*",
      "destination": "/index.html"
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/api/:path*",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
          "value": "*"
        },
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Methods",
          "value": "GET,OPTIONS,PATCH,DELETE,POST,PUT"
        },
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Headers",
          "value": "X-CSRF-Token,X-Requested-With,Accept,Accept-Version,Content-Length,Content-MD5,Content-Type,Date,X-Api-Version,Authorization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Frame-Options",
          "value": "DENY"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-XSS-Protection",
          "value": "1; mode=block"
        },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": false,
  "github": {
    "enabled": true,
    "autoAlias": true,
    "silent": false
  },
  "git": {
    "repo": "your-github-username/your-repo-name",
    "type": "github"
  },
  "alias": [
    "example.com",
    "www.example.com"
  ],
  "integrations": [
    {
      "id": "oac_YOUR_INTEGRATION_ID"
    }
  ]
}
```

**ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES SETUP GUIDE:**

**Frontend (.env.production):**
```
# REQUIRED - Backend API Endpoint
REACT_APP_API_ENDPOINT=https://api-staging.example.com
REACT_APP_API_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com (production)

# API Configuration
REACT_APP_API_TIMEOUT=30000
REACT_APP_ENVIRONMENT=staging|production
```

**Backend (Node.js/Express) - .env:**
```
# Server Configuration
NODE_ENV=production|staging
PORT=3001
HOST=0.0.0.0

# Database Connection
DB_HOST=your-db-host.example.com
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=your_database_name
DB_USER=db_user
DB_PASSWORD=your_secure_db_password
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://${DB_USER}:${DB_PASSWORD}@${DB_HOST}:${DB_PORT}/${DB_NAME}

# CORS Configuration
CORS_ORIGIN=https://example.com,https://staging.example.com,http://localhost:3000
CORS_CREDENTIALS=true

# Email Service (SendGrid/Nodemailer)
EMAIL_SERVICE_PROVIDER=sendgrid|smtp
SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.your_sendgrid_api_key
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@example.com
SMTP_PASS=your_email_password
SMTP_FROM=noreply@example.com

# JWT & Security
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_min_32_chars
JWT_EXPIRY=7d
ENCRYPTION_KEY=your_encryption_key

# Monitoring & Logging
LOG_LEVEL=info|debug
SENTRY_DSN=https://your_sentry_dsn@sentry.io/project_id
```

**Backend CORS Express Configuration:**
```javascript
const cors = require('cors');
app.use(cors({
  origin: process.env.CORS_ORIGIN?.split(',') || '*',
  credentials: process.env.CORS_CREDENTIALS === 'true',
  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE', 'PATCH', 'OPTIONS'],
  allowedHeaders: ['Content-Type', 'Authorization']
}));
```

**Vercel Project Configuration (vercel.json deployment):**
- Set environment variables in Vercel Dashboard: Settings > Environment Variables
- Create separate projects for staging and production, or use git branches
- Staging: Deploy from `develop` branch
- Production: Deploy from `main` branch
- Enable Preview Deployments for all PRs

**GitHub Actions CI/CD (optional .github/workflows/deploy.yml):**
- Triggers on push to `main` (production) and `develop` (staging)
- Runs tests, lint, builds, then triggers Vercel deployment
- Uses Vercel CLI for automated deployments
- Requires VERCEL_TOKEN and VERCEL_ORG_ID secrets in GitHub